## KPI Cards — Detail

6 cards in a responsive grid (`grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3`):

| Card | Icon | Value | Sub-label |
|---|---|---|---|
| Total Treasurers | `group` | `total_treasurers` | `active_treasurers` active |
| Total Revenue | `credit-card` | `KES {total_revenue_kes}` | All-time |
| Active Subscriptions | `badge-check` | `active_subscriptions` | of `total_treasurers` |
| Open Tickets | `ticket` | `pending_tickets` | In support queue |
| AI Accuracy | `brain` | `{ai_accuracy_rate * 100}%` | Parser confidence |
| Feedback | `feedback` | total feedback items | `{new}` new |

Each card has:
- Icon (top-left, in a `bg-primary/10` rounded box)
- Value (large, `text-2xl font-bold`)
- Label (small, `text-muted-foreground`)
- Sub-label or badge (secondary info)

