## Revenue Trend (30d)

A thin bar chart or sparkline using **Recharts** (already available in the project via shadcn/ui charts if present, or a lightweight import).

If Recharts is not in the project, render a **pure CSS bar chart** using Tailwind dynamic heights — no external dependency added.

Bar chart:
- X-axis: abbreviated date (e.g. "Aug 1")
- Y-axis: KES amount
- Hover tooltip: `KES {amount}` on `{date}`
- Bar color: `hsl(var(--primary))`
- Zero-amount bars: `bg-muted`

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Before implementing, I will check `package.json` to confirm whether Recharts or any charting library is already installed. If not, I will use a pure CSS solution — no new dependencies without confirmation.

